    "moderate": "CAUTION! COMPUTATIONAL EXPERIMENTATION NEARING MAXIMUM VOLTAGE.",
    "highLoad": "WHAT ARE YOU DOING IN MY LABORATORY?! COMPUTATIONAL OVERLOAD!",
    "critical": "DEE DEE! DO NOT PUSH THAT BUTTON! CORE MELTDOWN IN PROGRESS!",
    "night": "AH, THE TRANQUILITY OF LATE-NIGHT SCIENTIFIC DISCOVERY."
